## Start

```bash
pnpm install
cp .env.example .env
pnpm db:migrate
pnpm dev
```

Set `DATABASE_URL` and the `LLM_*` values in `.env` first. `pnpm db:migrate` needs a running Postgres.

## Checks

```bash
pnpm lint
pnpm format:check
pnpm exec next typegen && pnpm exec tsc --noEmit
pnpm test
pnpm build
```

